Changed native HTTP route handlers registered with `<ploneasgi:route />` to sync functions, `handler(ctx, request)`, that return a Starlette `Response`: they run in a worker thread inside the context the permission was checked in, so a request opens one ZODB connection and authenticates once instead of twice. The request body is read before the handler runs and reaches `ctx.request.form`; `NotAuthenticated` becomes a 401, `Unauthorized` a 403 and a malformed body a 400. Websocket handlers are unchanged. @ericof
